  "chapter": {
    "number": 149,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "Alleluia."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Sing to the Lord a new song: his praise is in the assembly of the saints.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let Israel rejoice in him that made him; and let the children of Sion exult in their king.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Let them praise his name in the dance: let them sings praises to him with timbrel and lute.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For the Lord takes pleasure in his people; and will exalt the meek with salvation.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The saints shall rejoice in glory; and shall exult on their beds.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 269
          },
          {
            "text": "high praises of God shall be in their throat, and two-edged swords in their hands;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "to execute vengeance on the nations, and punishments among the peoples;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "to bind their kings with fetters, and their nobles with manacles of iron; to execute on them the judgment",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 270
          },
          {
            "text": "written: this honor have all his saints.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 269,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Gr. exaltations, q.d. extollings.",
